{
    "title": "Find It Out: Hidden Objects",
    "description": "Welcome to the most captivating FREE hidden object and scavenger hunt game ! Embark on a scavenger hunt adventure, find hidden objects across challenging levels, and unwind your mind. Play now and DISCOVER the excitement!\r\n\r\nIn this free scavenger hunt picture puzzle, simply focus on the items listed below, tap on the hidden objects, and bring these captivating scenes to life. Take on the challenge and solve the hidden objects puzzles with speed and precision!\r\n\r\nAs an innovative search and find hidden object game, Find It offers multiple vibrant maps and engaging game scenes for you to uncover missing objects. Explore numerous mysterious locations, find all hidden objects, and unlock new maps for free in this ultimate Find It and scavenger hunt puzzle game!\r\n\r\nSearch, seek, and find out in stunning graphics, collecting hundreds of hidden objects for endless scavenger hunt fun. If you're a fan of find hidden objects games, Spot It games, and other scavenger hunt puzzles, this free brain teaser is the perfect fit for you!\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\ud83c\udf89 Completely free to play - indulge in the joy of hidden object games!\r\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Easy rules and gameplay - survey the scene, find hidden objects, and complete the picture!\r\n\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 Suitable for all age groups - enjoy the picture puzzle game with family and friends!\r\n\u2705 Varied difficulties - the more hidden objects you find, the tougher the maps you can tackle.\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Carefully designed hidden objects - put your searching skills to the test!\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Handy tools - use hints to locate the last hidden object when you're stuck.\r\n\u2b50 Zoom feature - magnify your view at any time to spot well-hidden objects!\r\n\ud83e\udd29 Multiple levels and scenes - explore the animal park, ocean world, children's playground, and more exciting destinations!\r\n\ud83c\udfae Different gaming modes - play with Classic and Match modes as per your preference!\r\n\r\nHow to Play\r\n\ud83e\uddd0 Observe, seek, and find the required hidden objects.\r\n\ud83e\udded Use hints to locate the target and uncover it.\r\n\ud83d\udd0e Zoom in, out, and swipe through every corner of the maps.\r\n\ud83d\udcaa Collect all hidden objects to complete a scene.\r\n\r\nExperience the exhilaration of discovering treasures through our weekly updated maps! Immerse yourself in a diverse collection of captivating maps, including San Francisco, Miracle Street, Ocean Resort, Magic Forest, Wild West, Mysterious Japan, Lamp Of Wonders, Alien Exploration, Dreamy Factory, and many more.\r\n\r\nGet set for an unforgettable journey into a realm filled with wonder and excitement. Join us today!\r\n\r\nFind It Out - Find Hidden Objects is the quintessential 'seek, find, and find out game' to enhance your observation skills! Stay sharp and be patient! Take a close look at the map, uncover all hidden objects, and reveal the mysteries within!\r\n\r\nWe're always improving and genuinely love hearing your feedback, so contact us at orangplayer@tggamesstudio.com or visit our website https://tggamesstudio.com.\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://tggamesstudio.com/privacy.html\r\nTerms of Service: https://tggamesstudio.com/useragreement.html",
